      "text": "High  │\n  Inter-│                              ╔══════════════╗\n  active│                              ║     Fish     ║  <- designed for humans\n  UX    │                              ║  autosugg.   ║     not for /bin/sh compat\n        │               ┌─────────────╫──────────────╫──┐\n        │               │    Zsh      ╚══════════════╝  │\n        │               │  (+ Oh My   Zsh is mid-POSIX, │\n        │               │    Zsh)     high UX w/plugins │\n        │               └─────────────────────────────-─┘\n        │    ┌──────────────────┐\n        │    │      Bash        │\n        │    │   ubiquitous;    │\n        │    │   POSIX-close;   │\n        │    │   UX: workable   │\n        │    └──────────────────┘\n  Low   │  ┌──────┐\n  Inter-│  │  sh  │  <- POSIX reference; minimal; CI/container default\n  active│  └──────┘\n  UX    │\n        └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────\n             Low POSIX compat            High POSIX compat"
    },
